  segments:
  - name: GuardIdle
    sourceEntry: Fight_Boxing_mixamo
    start: 7
    end: 9.2
    category: 0
    loop: 1
    keepFacing: 1
    review: 1
    notes: Reviewed 2026-10-01 (frame-by-frame window render). Tight boxing guard
      with a light bounce; 7.0-9.2 s only (a jab follows at ~10 s). Looped (loop
      pose on).
  - name: JabCross
    sourceEntry: Fight_ShadowBoxing_mixamo
    start: 8
    end: 9.6
    category: 1
    loop: 0
    keepFacing: 1
    review: 1
    notes: Reviewed 2026-10-01 (frame-by-frame window render). Guard -> left jab
      (extended at ~8.35 s) -> right cross (~8.7 s, 7 m/s hand peak) -> back to guard.
  - name: JabHook
    sourceEntry: Fight_ShadowBoxing_mixamo
    start: 19.2
    end: 20.8
    category: 1
    loop: 0
    keepFacing: 1
    review: 1
    notes: Reviewed 2026-10-01 (frame-by-frame window render). Jab then a big rotating
      right hook/overhand (~19.9 s, 6.5 m/s) with full body turn, recovers to guard.
      Heavier than JabCross.
  - name: FrontKick
    sourceEntry: Fight_BigFrontKick_mixamo
    start: 3.3
    end: 4.6
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    keepFacing: 1
    review: 1
    notes: Reviewed 2026-10-01 (frame-by-frame window render). Guard, knee chamber,
      front kick (~3.85 s), recover. The kick is compact (not a high snap).
  - name: SpinningRoundhouse
    sourceEntry: Fight_RoundHouseKick_mixamo
    start: 6.9
    end: 8.4
    category: 2
    loop: 0
    keepFacing: 0
    review: 1
    notes: 'Reviewed 2026-10-01 (frame-by-frame window render). Spinning back roundhouse:
      turns away, chambers, kicks (~7.8 s, 9 m/s foot peak). Ends facing ~away from
      the start direction.'
  - name: CoverBlock
    sourceEntry: Fight_ShadowBoxing_mixamo
    start: 12.8
    end: 14
    category: 4
    loop: 0
    keepFacing: 1
    review: 1
    notes: 'Reviewed 2026-10-01 (frame-by-frame window render). High cover-up: both
      forearms tight in front of the face while shuffling. A body block, not a parry.'
  - name: DuckWeave
    sourceEntry: Fight_ShadowBoxing_mixamo
    start: 14
    end: 15.3
    category: 5
    loop: 0
    keepFacing: 1
    review: 1
    notes: Reviewed 2026-10-01 (frame-by-frame window render). Drops lower under
      the cover and weaves, then rises. The best 'dodge' in the packs (no dedicated
      dodge clip exists).
  - name: HeadSnap
    sourceEntry: Fight_KnockOut_Loser_mixamo
    start: 8.8
    end: 10.3
    category: 6
    loop: 0
    keepFacing: 1
    review: 1
    notes: 'Reviewed 2026-10-01 (frame-by-frame window render). Takes a hit: head
      snaps back, body twists and staggers. Does NOT recover to guard (it continues
      into the fall).'
  - name: KnockedDown
    sourceEntry: Fight_KnockOut_Loser_mixamo
    start: 8.8
    end: 12.6
    category: 7
    loop: 0
    keepFacing: 1
    review: 1
    notes: 'Reviewed 2026-10-01 (frame-by-frame window render). Hit -> stagger ->
      crouching collapse -> falls onto the back (lying from ~11.7 s). Lying body
      grounded after the robust ground fix. Source glitch: at the floor impact (~11.8
      s) the capture drops ~23 cm for ~0.3 s (reads as a hard slam); excluded from
      the ground calibration.'
  - name: GetUp
    sourceEntry: Fight_KnockOut_Loser_mixamo
    start: 16.3
    end: 20.4
    category: 8
    loop: 0
    keepFacing: 1
    review: 1
    notes: 'Reviewed 2026-10-01 (frame-by-frame window render). From lying on the
      back: sits up, crouches, rises hunched to standing. Pairs with KnockedDown.'
  - name: FistRaised
    sourceEntry: MartialArts_BattleTaunts_WithSword_MIXAMO_769
    start: 6.8
    end: 11.5
    category: 10
    loop: 0
    keepFacing: 1
    review: 1
    notes: Reviewed 2026-10-01 (frame-by-frame window render). Right fist raised
      high and held (~7-11 s), then lowers. The clearest victory pose in the packs.
